    "noteZh": "About 那段是 “React Native in-app purchases and subscriptions made easy. Support for iOS, Android and web.”，下面挂了 www.revenuecat.com 官网链接和 android、api、ios、react-native、stripe、web 六个标签。根目录的文件列表很长，react-native-purchases-ui、react-native-purchases-store-galaxy、migrations、apitesters、fastlane、e2e-tests、examples 各占一行，CI 走的是 .circleci。提交历史大半是 “AUTOMATIC BUMP” 和语义化发布，最新一条把 purchases-hybrid-common 升到 19.0.0。侧栏是 MIT license、1.2k stars、Used by 2.2K、Releases 293 条。",
